{"title":"4. 进程如何使用内存","uid":"6a6eb5b4020fd6d9b5abd63b042fe8f3","slug":"进程与内存/4. 进程如何使用内存","date":"2025-04-05T14:30:00.000Z","updated":"2025-04-05T07:09:20.113Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/进程与内存/4. 进程如何使用内存.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h2 id=\"虚拟内存和物理页\"><a href=\"#虚拟内存和物理页\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"虚拟内存和物理页\"></a>虚拟内存和物理页</h2><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>在内存使用中，一个非常重要的概念就是<code>虚拟内存和物理内存的关系</code>，理解清楚这二者的联系与区别非常重要</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虚拟地址空间\"><a href=\"#虚拟地址空间\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"虚拟地址空间\"></a>虚拟地址空间</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>虚拟内存的管理是以<code>进程</code>为单位的，每个进程都有一个虚拟地址空间。在实现上，每个进程的task_struct都有一个核心对象——<code>mm_struct</code>类型的mm。它代表的就是进程的虚拟地址空间。</p></blockquote>\n<p>在这个虚拟地址空间中，每一段已经分离出去的地址范围都是用一个个虚拟内存区域<code>VMA(Virtual Memory Area)</code>来表示的，在内核中对应的结构体是 <code>vm_area_struct</code>。</p>\n<figure class=\"shiki c\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">// include/linux/mm_types.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #676E95; font-style: italic\">// https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/include/linux/mm_types.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">struct</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> vm_area_struct </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #F07178\">    </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">unsigned</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">long</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\"> vm_start</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #F07178\">    </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">unsigned</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">long</span><span style=\"color: #F07178\"> vm_end</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #F07178\">    ......</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure>\n<p><code>vm_start</code>和<code>vm_end</code>表示启用的虚拟地址范围的开始和结束。当进程运行一段时间后，可能会分配出去许多段地址范围。那就会存在许多vm_area_struct对象，如下图所示:<br><img src=\"/../../images/linux/13.png\" alt=\"13.png\"></p>\n<p>许多个vm_area_struct对象各自所指明的已分配出去的地址范围，加起来就是对整个虚拟地址空间的占用情况。当然，内核会保证各个vm_area_struct对象之间的地址范围不存在交叉的情况。</p>\n<p>在linux6.1版本之前，使用红黑树+双向链表管理<code>vm_area_struct</code>对象，如下图所示；在linux6.1版本中，对VMA的管理被替换成了<code>mapple tree</code>，原因是现在服务器上的核数越来越多，应用程序的线程也越来越多，多线程情况下锁争抢的问题开始出现，mapple tree从一开始就按照无锁的方式来设计的。<br><img src=\"/../../images/linux/14.png\" alt=\"14.png\"></p>\n","feature":true,"text":"虚拟内存和物理页 在内存使用中，一个非常重要的概念就是虚拟内存和物理内存的关系，理解清楚这二者的联系与区别非常重要 虚拟地址空间 虚拟内存的管理是以进程为单位的...","permalink":"/post/进程与内存/4. 进程如何使用内存","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":820,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":4,"path":"api/categories/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"内存","slug":"内存","count":8,"path":"api/tags/内存.json"},{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":4,"path":"api/tags/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%92%8C%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E9%A1%B5\"><span class=\"toc-text\">虚拟内存和物理页</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4\"><span class=\"toc-text\">虚拟地址空间</span></a></li></ol></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{},"next_post":{"title":"3. 系统物理内存初始化","uid":"4a63267d0cfd90161f0e125601420dc5","slug":"进程与内存/3. 系统物理内存初始化","date":"2025-04-05T09:30:00.000Z","updated":"2025-04-05T07:09:20.113Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/进程与内存/3. 系统物理内存初始化.json","keywords":null,"cover":"../../images/linux/04.png","text":"物理内存安装检测 在操作系统启动的时候要做的一件重要的事情就是探测可用物理内存的地址范围，内核请求中断号15H，并设置操作码为E820H，然后固件就会向内核报告...","permalink":"/post/进程与内存/3. 系统物理内存初始化","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.7k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":4,"path":"api/categories/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"内存","slug":"内存","count":8,"path":"api/tags/内存.json"},{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":4,"path":"api/tags/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"}],"author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"feature":true}}